Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 14:40:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] register the Lecithin diagnostic command root

/lecithin worlds and /lecithin context report identities the platform maintains
but exposes through no Bukkit API: which ServerLevel a world really is, which
ThreadedRegionizer owns it, which region the calling thread is ticking, and what
level and position the CommandSourceStack in hand carries. Read-only.

diff --git a/src/main/java/me/earthme/luminol/commands/CommandRegister.java b/src/main/java/me/earthme/luminol/commands/CommandRegister.java
index a4821ce79cfcf8ebe5926f8ed382dad50b260532..5809844142f741544ad3bafce3f7b7ec4b27bd2b 100644
--- a/src/main/java/me/earthme/luminol/commands/CommandRegister.java
+++ b/src/main/java/me/earthme/luminol/commands/CommandRegister.java
@@ -10,5 +10,6 @@ public class CommandRegister {
      */
     public static void register() {
         new BarCommand().register();
+        new fun.bm.lecithin.command.LecithinCommand().register(); // Lecithin - diagnostic command root
     }
 }
